From 90a317f7170d73619668ea51e3ca910fbaa48ade Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:13:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 100/140] feat: Add custom theme and wallpaper editor screens

- Implemented CustomThemeEditorScreen for creating and editing custom themes.
- Added WallpaperEditorScreen for adjusting wallpaper settings including zoom and position.
- Introduced AppWallpaper functionality to manage and display custom wallpapers.
- Updated string resources for new features in multiple languages.
- Enhanced theme customization options with additional color attributes.
